{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamble Lair</strong> is a sinister twist on Rock\u2013Paper\u2013Scissors \u2014 a game of death where your life is measured in tokens, turning chance into pure strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>Kinger</strong>, the House\u2019s cruel champion, in high-stakes duels where every turn forces you to wager your survival. Your tokens are both your health and your currency. Lose them all, and you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the rounds progress, the <strong>House itself intervenes</strong>, introducing streak multipliers, sudden death rounds, and shifting rules that make each match deadlier than the last. <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093750/extras/ca1af056531c6550e1af27602eb74ba8.avif?t=1761745690\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your goal is simple: <strong>bankrupt Kinger before he bankrupts you.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock\u2013Paper\u2013Scissors like you\u2019ve never seen before \u2014 open hands, betting, and mind games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tokens are your life and your wallet \u2014 gamble them or save them for perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed tools and perks reshape every duel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, brutal runs with multiple endings to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online PvP mode to wager your survival against real opponents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPS reimagined \u2014 a game of chance transformed into a game of strategy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093750/extras/45490db6ec873a2cdb63faf169c2a747.avif?t=1761745690\" width=903 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3093750?t=1761745690","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3093750?t=1761745690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093750/2978f9f5d0135da0d517e0fd424e4cafedcba26c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761745690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093750/2978f9f5d0135da0d517e0fd424e4cafedcba26c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761745690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game revolves around gambling for your life"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamble Lair</strong> is a sinister twist on Rock\u2013Paper\u2013Scissors \u2014 a game of death where your life is measured in tokens, turning chance into pure strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>Kinger</strong>, the House\u2019s cruel champion, in high-stakes duels where every turn forces you to wager your survival. Your tokens are both your health and your currency. Lose them all, and you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the rounds progress, the <strong>House itself intervenes</strong>, introducing streak multipliers, sudden death rounds, and shifting rules that make each match deadlier than the last. <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst